    "16637947412bca5d08": {
      "type": "quotes",
      "blocks": {
        "16637947411f2692ac-2": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“I made my first purchase so I got the one yard scarf, I am so pleased with it... actually, I love it! It's comfortable, it's soft and it looks great! My purchase experience was great and shipping was fast. Absolutely recommend!”</p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        },
        "9ce23cce-4719-4328-b639-f730f57cd3e7": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>\"Perfect comfort - perfect fit\"</p>",
            "author": "Donna V."
          }
        },
        "58dfb1fb-5090-4fe2-95af-a4bcdaa6162e": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>I have 5 of these in different colors. I love them! I also have a few 1 yard and a few 3 yard wraps. They are so beautiful, chic and soft. Each elevates the look of my outfit</p>",
            "author": "Patricia L."
          }
        },
        "0b32d508-6883-48ba-829a-45da3d66a768": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>\"I can't get enough of the 3 yard wrap! It's the most luxurious fabric I've ever worn and I've given up cashmere for it, why? Because it's a superior fabric and it's washable!\"</p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        },
        "47ff77ee-0aeb-4a50-b975-664f35a94a08": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>The fabric is like butter... even better in person! The fit is definitely oversized, but what I expected.</p>",
            "author": ""
          }
        }
      },
